{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093880/extras/gplay.png?t=1743012031\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Up to 8 players spawn in an enclosed arena where they must battle it out.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Taking damage results in increased knockback. Don't get hit out of the arena!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Obtaining rifts will grant players new weapons, spawn events, or give deadly curses.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>For each round you survive,\u00a0 you get money to help secure your victory!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093880/extras/usef1.gif?t=1743012031\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093880/extras/usef2.gif?t=1743012031\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093880/extras/garena.png?t=1743012031\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Over 25+ arenas and more to come in future updates.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Each arena has unique obstacles that make players adapt playstyle.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Breakable Floors, Moveable Blocks, Swinging Maces, and more.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093880/extras/usef3.gif?t=1743012031\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093880/extras/usef4.gif?t=1743012031\" /></p><p class=\"bb_pa